{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Ultimate is a modern interpretation of the classic Snake game with enhanced features and a fresh design. The game combines the proven gameplay of the original with new challenges and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic Snake gameplay with modern graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highscore system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Achievement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Classic Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Traditional Snake game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Increasing speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Score collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Challenge Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Special challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Time-based tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Special power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrow keys for movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- P key for pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ESC for menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic background music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visual effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adjustable playfield size</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various snake skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Requirements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Windows operating system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modern hardware (see system_requirements.txt)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At least 100 MB free storage space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Python and Pygame, Snake Ultimate offers a smooth gaming experience with modern graphics and sound. The game is suitable for both casual gamers and fans of the classic Snake game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Online features and multiplayer mode are planned for future updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3426640?t=1747210934","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426640/cffa1525799316a7535cd718ad3ee231296397ca/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747210934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426640/aafeece83b25b12d191421678d74d10033a45ccb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747210934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426640/aafeece83b25b12d191421678d74d10033a45ccb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747210934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake Ultimate is a modern interpretation of the classic Snake game with enhanced features and a fresh design. The game combines the proven gameplay of the original with new challenges and features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic Snake gameplay with modern graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple difficulty levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Highscore system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Achievement system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customizable controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various game modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Classic Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Traditional Snake game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Increasing speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Score collection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Challenge Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Special challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Time-based tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Special power-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrow keys for movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- P key for pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ESC for menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic background music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visual effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Adjustable playfield size</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various snake skins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System Requirements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Windows operating system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Modern hardware (see system_requirements.txt)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- At least 100 MB free storage space</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Python and Pygame, Snake Ultimate offers a smooth gaming experience with modern graphics and sound. The game is suitable for both casual gamers and fans of the classic Snake game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Online features and multiplayer mode are planned for future updates.</p>","developers":["GFZ Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426640/048733e3eff56c50615e8a248b6669a8afb6dfc1/header.jpg?t=1747210934","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3426640/807327/4ce3ad91f4940029e4982282314de7bbd24fc174/1750849881/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746139568","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3426640/807327/4ce3ad91f4940029e4982282314de7bbd24fc174/1750849881/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746139568","highlight":true,"h